name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q6_2026'

question 'A QA Engineer reports: "Steps to reproduce: open app, click Start, click Pause. Expected: timer stops. Actual: timer keeps running." What part of the bug report is most useful to a developer trying to fix it?'

wrong 'The QA Engineer''s job title.'
right 'The exact steps to reproduce the bug and the gap between expected and actual behavior.'
wrong 'How long the QA Engineer spent finding it.'
wrong 'A guess about which library is broken.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

